{
  "claim": "turning and folding connects the growths (tau/1*1, mu/1*mu=delta, Lambda/mu*log) in ONE cartesian field, but only the fold itself is exact - the breaking (Delta, M, psi-x error terms) is measured, unquantifiable at any finite height, and the upper/lower body mirror is a metaphor the numbers neither confirm nor deny.",
